{"unit_id":"AKS1st__dock#card-zh","repo":"AKS1st/dock","commit":"8535f6e24670931d9e93fb087ab474e38aa01856","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dock-base 是面向 DSH Web 的工作台基础插件，提供活动栏、侧边栏、编辑器标签区、面板和状态栏。它通过 ctx.workbench 注册表让其他插件注册面板、编辑器视图、活动项、状态项、命令与设置，并管理视图打开、关闭及浮动窗口。用户可以调整停靠位置、自动隐藏和图标放大，并在本地保存布局和设置。适合希望为 DSH Web 组合可扩展工作区的用户；安装命令为 dsh plugin --profile web add dock-base。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:18-55","src/client/service.ts:124-205","src/client/layout.ts:32-130"]}
{"unit_id":"AKS1st__dock#card-en","repo":"AKS1st/dock","commit":"8535f6e24670931d9e93fb087ab474e38aa01856","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dock-base adds a DSH Web workbench with an activity bar, sidebar, editor tabs, panel and status bar. Extensions register views, commands and settings through ctx.workbench. Open floating views and save layout preferences in browser storage. Install with dsh plugin --profile web add dock-base.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:18-55","src/client/service.ts:124-205","src/client/layout.ts:32-130"]}
